       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.           TDTLCHGS.
       AUTHOR.               MK MADDEN.
       DATE-WRITTEN.         JUNE 12, 1985.
      *INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.

      *REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THROUGH THE
      *                      DETAIL TRANSACTION DATA SET
      *                      AND FIND ALL ISS, ADJ, RET, RETV AND DIRECT
      *                      INVOICE TCS AND SORT AND PRINT THEM
      *                      IN REPORT CODE, LEDGER CODE, DEPT, CLASS,
      *                      AND DEPT/ACCOUNT ORDER.
      *C
      *C 27MAY1992    DAVE PLUM   REQUEST # 6196
      *C REVISED PARAGRAPH 500-GET-MMATL-ACCUM TO INCLUDE THE
      *C IF STATEMENT 'IF TRANS-CODE = "INV" OR "FRT"',  INSTEAD OF
      *C 'IF TRANS-CODE = "INV"'.  FRT CHARGES FOR CODED ITEMS HAVING
      *C NEW-WORK NUMBERS WERE NOT BEING TREATED THE SAME AS INVOICE
      *C CHARGES.
      *C
      *C 08FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C 08JUL1994    CR KALMAN   REQUEST # 6090
      *C REVISED DETAIL OF CHARGES REPORT TO HANDLE INVALID DEPTS.
      *C IT NO LONGER BLOWS UP WHEN AN INVALID DEPT IS FOUND.  IT
      *C NOW PRINTS AN "INVALID DEPT" MESSAGE AND AT THE END OF THE
      *C PROGRAM, THE FILE VCH85FLE IS CLEARED.
      *C
      *C 08DEC1994    CA ZUBEK    REQUEST # 94-050
      *C ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT OUT CONTROL BREAK TOTALS ON REPORT FOR
      *C VOUCHER 24.  SUB-TOTALS SHOW THE ACCUMULATED TOTALS FOR
      *C QUANTITY, ACTUAL, STANDARD, AND VARIANCE COLUMNS AFTER EACH
      *C CORPORATE CODE.
      *C
      *C 04SEP1996    CA YODER
      *C RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C 01DEC1997    CA YODER    REQ #: 97-014
      *C DIRECTED PRINTED OUTPUT TO FILE "DDTLCHGS" INSTEAD OF TO
      *C MCPRT.  THIS WILL ALLOW PROCESSING THE REPORT THROUGH
      *C "TPRTRPT" WHICH WILL DIRECT THE OUTPUT TO DIFFERENT OUTQS
      *C BASED ON DEPARTMENT.
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DTRANS-MC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MMATL-ACCUM-MC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0601
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MCHT-ACCTS-DP-I
